  "instructions": [
    "Wash and thinly slice the beetroot.",
    "Mix salt with water to make a brine. Soak the slices in this for about 10 minutes.",
    "Drain the slices, pat dry, and coat lightly with vegetable shortening.",
    "Fold leafy greens around each slice of beets for wrapping.",
    "Place wraps on a wooden board and steam gently until tender (about 5-7 minutes).",
    "Serve immediately."
